outcome = SubResource("Resource_sprvr")
outcome_text = "The scouts gather the dry twigs and the dead branches that have fallen from the trees.

They assemble these into a large bonfire on the beach, and stay late into the night reminiscing about all the adventures they have experienced over their lifetimes."

